  "balance_notes": [
    "Pack identity is slow-stack-into-burst. Fenrir Werewolf is the only true damage carry; everything else softens enemies for it.",
    "Bonechill Barrier + Draugar Lord in series should fully freeze most armored enemies for 1-2s.",
    "Crystal Beetle is the only cost-4 unit — fills the early-wave affordability slot.",
    "Frozen Core relic shifts the deck from 'control' to 'control + execute' if it lands.",
    "Blizzard Assault wave hard-counters straight slow strategies; mix in a Lyonar or neutral damage unit before wave 7.",
    "Without Frozen Core, Vanar shells slightly under-perform pure damage factions; that's intentional — relic carries the build."
  ]
